But your fix will mean that puddings are rendered to harmless. In your 
version my underdeveloped character can just split up the dangerous 
pudding so that each split have so little hitpoits that even she can 
kill them with a puny dagger.

The whole idea of puddings not having limited hp is that splitting them 
is dangerous.

Much better solution would have been to mark the new puddings as 
splitted and not allowing splitted puddings leave corpses, give 
experience and a death drop.

This would eliminate all reasons to pudding farm but still leave 
puddings dangerous.


